    <title>Counter模块</title>
    <link href="/2026/04/19/Counter/"/>
    <url>/2026/04/19/Counter/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="counter模块"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#counter模块"></a> Counter模块</h1><h2 id="一-是什么"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#一-是什么"></a> 一、是什么</h2><p><code>Counter</code> 是 <code>collections</code> 中的<strong>计数工具</strong>，用于统计<strong>列表、字符串、元组</strong>等可迭代对象中元素出现次数。</p><h2 id="二-基本使用"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#二-基本使用"></a> 二、基本使用</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> collections <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Counter<br><br>data = [<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,<span class="hljs-number">2</span>,<span class="hljs-number">2</span>,<span class="hljs-number">3</span>,<span class="hljs-number">3</span>,<span class="hljs-number">3</span>,<span class="hljs-number">4</span>,<span class="hljs-number">4</span>,<span class="hljs-number">4</span>,<span class="hljs-number">4</span>]<br>c = Counter(data)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三-常用操作必背"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#三-常用操作必背"></a> 三、常用操作（必背）</h2><ol><li><strong>获取某个元素的次数</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(c[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>])   <span class="hljs-comment"># 2</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li><strong>获取所有元素（键）</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(c.keys())<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li><strong>获取所有次数（值）</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(c.values())<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="4"><li><strong>获取前 N 个出现最多的元素</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(c.most_common(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>))  <span class="hljs-comment"># 最多2个</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="5"><li><strong>获取出现次数最少的元素</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(c.most_common()[-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>])<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="6"><li><strong>遍历所有元素和次数</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> k, v <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> c.items():<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(k, v)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr /><h2 id="四-高频场景一次拿到最多和最少"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#四-高频场景一次拿到最多和最少"></a> 四、高频场景：一次拿到【最多】和【最少】</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> collections <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Counter<br><br>lst = [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;c&#x27;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;c&#x27;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;c&#x27;</span>]<br>c = Counter(lst)<br><br>max_item = c.most_common(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>)       <span class="hljs-comment"># 最多</span><br>min_item = c.most_common()[-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]    <span class="hljs-comment"># 最少</span><br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;最多：&quot;</span>, max_item)<br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;最少：&quot;</span>, min_item)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr /><h2 id="五-极简总结"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#五-极简总结"></a> 五、极简总结</h2><ul><li>导入：<code>from collections import Counter</code></li><li>统计：<code>Counter(可迭代对象)</code></li><li>最多：<code>most_common(1)</code></li><li>最少：<code>most_common()[-1]</code></li><li>取值：<code>c[key]</code></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
